      <data key="n0">skill</data>
      <data key="n1">model-pruning</data>
      <data key="n2">Reduce LLM size and accelerate inference using pruning techniques like Wanda and SparseGPT. Use when compressing models without retraining, achieving 50% sparsity with minimal accuracy loss, or enabling faster inference on hardware accelerators. Covers unstructured pruning, structured pruning, N:M sparsity, magnitude pruning, and one-shot methods.</data>
      <data key="n3">multimodal-and-emerging</data>
      <data key="n4">skills/model-pruning</data>
